Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.13,0:00:05.67,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.09,0:00:11.25,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,What a cute little kitten, Ioryogi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.25,0:00:12.21,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Sign TS,0000,0000,0000,,I can no longer care for it. Please take it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.53,0:00:17.18,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,“I can no longer care for it. Please take it.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.18,0:00:20.39,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t you dare get another one of your ideas!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.39,0:00:22.61,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s so soft and cuddly!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.61,0:00:24.61,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,And you just went ahead and did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.61,0:00:27.61,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I can’t leave this little kitten all by itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.61,0:00:29.57,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Then what are you going to do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.01,0:00:32.99,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.99,0:00:38.32,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,This way, the kitten won’t be all alone, and I’ll be able to find people to heal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:42.09,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,So you’ll spend the rest of your miserable life here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,{OP}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,{A Kitten’s Lullaby [forgot what was TS’d last time]}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.41,0:02:17.67,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Acting like you have no problems of your own to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.67,0:02:19.68,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,And now you’re caring for a kitten? What a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.13,0:02:24.18,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I can’t just leave it by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.27,0:02:30.51,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Now we have a stray cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.51,0:02:34.19,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You’re wrong! The owner said it can no longer be cared for!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.19,0:02:35.53,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It’s the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.86,0:02:40.49,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,If you aren’t willing to care for it to the end, then leave it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.33,0:02:44.39,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He’s mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.39,0:02:46.22,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But he’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.11,0:02:50.50,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Kittie?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.50,0:02:54.46,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What’s wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:56.01,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It’s obviously hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Book TS,0000,0000,0000,,[top banner]Hanamaro Drills/[white bubble below]Math/[white letter blue ray-left]All done!/[white letter in blue ray-right]Fun!}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.47,0:03:04.68,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Chiho-chan… what’s the answer to number five?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.68,0:03:07.47,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? You don’t know either, Chise?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.95,0:03:12.44,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.98,0:03:15.16,KM,Chiho(?),0000,0000,0000,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.16,0:03:16.79,KM,Chise(?),0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.79,0:03:18.36,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good day to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.83,0:03:20.57,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I need food, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.97,0:03:26.46,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Mama is out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.46,0:03:27.74,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,This is all we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.45,0:03:31.94,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um, too much sugar will be…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.94,0:03:32.74,KM,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.74,0:03:35.22,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I wasn’t referring to me! It’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:38.30,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,It’s for this kitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.30,0:03:39.54,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:41.08,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:43.84,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It seems the owner can’t take care of it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.29,0:03:47.06,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,If you have any food you can share with it…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:48.46,KM,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Shhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.95,0:03:52.81,KM,??,0000,0000,0000,,Can we go to your room?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:55.44,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.44,0:03:57.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{*disturbing foley*} {Keeper: epic lol, but we no can keep this =-p}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.28,0:04:00.47,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,It really seems to like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.47,0:04:01.91,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.91,0:04:06.95,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um, why are you two talking in such hushed voices?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.57,0:04:14.97,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,This apartment building forbids pets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.97,0:04:17.37,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Someone who lived here once had a dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.37,0:04:20.83,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,who barked so loud that\Nthe neighbors complained.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.83,0:04:21.59,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,After that…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.59,0:04:26.59,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,…Mama began refusing to let the tenants keep any pets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.37,0:04:31.44,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So I can’t take care of it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.44,0:04:34.83,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Why don’t you ask the owner to take it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.83,0:04:36.52,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t know the owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.52,0:04:41.86,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I found the kitten in a box\Nwith no name written on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.37,0:04:47.54,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Really? Then, if this keeps up,\Nthe kitten will be all alone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:51.94,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,It would be a good idea to find a new owner…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:58.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow, I’ll ask Sayaka-sensei at Yomogi Preschool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:02.41,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-san is sure to agree!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.41,0:05:05.88,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,And we’ll get to see the kitten there anytime!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:07.87,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,So now we have to give it a name!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.87,0:05:09.47,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san? What would be good?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.47,0:05:11.54,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.54,0:05:13.67,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Uh… um…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.67,0:05:16.48,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I can’t think of anything that quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.91,0:05:24.13,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Since it’s milky white, how about Milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.13,0:05:26.32,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,And it loves milk too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.32,0:05:31.42,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Milk? That’s an adorable name! It’s wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.42,0:05:32.24,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Sign TS,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Preschool}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.22,0:05:36.21,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.21,0:05:37.46,KM,kid,0000,0000,0000,,It sure is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.46,0:05:39.39,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,And its name is Milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.39,0:05:40.42,KM,Yoshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Huh…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:42.63,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Come here, Milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.63,0:05:44.30,KM,kid,0000,0000,0000,,I want to hold it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.30,0:05:45.63,KM,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.63,0:05:47.13,KM,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Let me pet it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.13,0:05:49.79,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like everyone’s enjoying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.79,0:05:52.05,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So we can keep it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.05,0:05:56.35,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yuzuru-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.77,0:05:57.98,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Come with me for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.23,0:06:03.39,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.39,0:06:06.44,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yuzuru is allergic to cats, isn’t he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.77,0:06:09.02,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Allergic… to cats?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.37,0:06:14.54,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It means he sneezes, gets a rash and if it’s really bad, gets asthmatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.79,0:06:19.08,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.38,0:06:22.14,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,We can’t have a cat in this preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.25,0:06:24.34,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You’re right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.54,0:06:27.88,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, I’m really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:32.47,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,See how much trouble you caused everyone by being so impulsive?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.72,0:06:34.10,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Impulsive?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.10,0:06:36.27,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,So will you take care of it yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.27,0:06:37.48,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.48,0:06:41.53,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You’ll never feel complete if you only do things for your own satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.53,0:06:43.39,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,You’re just as bad as the\Nperson who abandoned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:49.61,KM,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry, Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.06,0:06:52.71,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I’m fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.71,0:06:55.50,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m really sorry too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.24,0:07:07.00,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.00,0:07:10.58,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Don’t play with me! I may look\Nlike a stuffed animal, but I’m not!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.21,0:07:13.70,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan? So you were here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.44,0:07:16.22,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.74,0:07:18.74,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Can I sit next to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.74,0:07:19.88,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:25.71,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry to disappoint you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.71,0:07:28.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t be. I’m the one who should be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.12,0:07:32.18,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-kun means well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:33.45,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,He probably…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.77,0:07:38.87,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,…sees a part of himself in that kitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:39.99,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.16,0:07:44.75,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, nevermind. I’ll help look for a new owner for that kitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.35,0:07:48.00,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t you fret. I’m sure we’ll find someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.59,0:07:50.01,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:53.22,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,So, what are you going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.74,0:07:56.39,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll look for Milk’s new owner!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.79,0:07:59.70,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I will not cause trouble for everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.70,0:08:00.64,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Count me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:03.23,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Especially since I’m getting it bad here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Sign TS,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Preschool}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.93,0:08:06.60,KM,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.71,0:08:10.23,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.82,0:08:12.11,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.11,0:08:13.28,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Is Milk around?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.08,0:08:20.07,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,An allergy to cats?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.07,0:08:22.71,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.71,0:08:23.75,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,It’s all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:26.09,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,I think we should ask Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.09,0:08:28.50,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,We can’t. Pets are forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:31.16,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Asking her would only bother her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.16,0:08:32.60,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,You’re right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.17,0:08:38.64,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anyone who will take care of this little kitten?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.64,0:08:42.14,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Please be this kitten’s new owner!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:44.89,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Please take care of this kitt…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.15,0:08:47.85,KM,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.61,0:08:50.65,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Chiho-chan! Chise-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.10,0:08:52.65,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Come here, Milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:54.35,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Have you been good?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:58.74,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry, I tried asking Sayaka-sensei…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.21,0:09:01.72,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,We just came from the preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:02.76,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.76,0:09:05.20,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,It’s not your fault, Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.20,0:09:09.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I haven’t found anyone who will take it home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.00,0:09:11.13,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,The two of us will search with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:14.38,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Milk, we promise we’ll find you a new owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.78,0:09:20.18,KM,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.66,0:09:22.89,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I already have my hands full with the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.97,0:09:28.70,KM,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Katherine, what’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.70,0:09:29.85,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.85,0:09:30.86,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:32.80,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,E-Excuse us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.25,0:09:38.36,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Can’t you salesmen ever leave me alone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.45,0:09:40.50,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Oh… huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.62,0:09:43.04,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.31,0:09:48.95,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Doumoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.78,0:09:51.05,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,{Eyecatches}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.91,0:10:09.39,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.39,0:10:10.35,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.44,0:10:15.90,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, that’s amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:18.38,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,So you want someone to take in that kitten?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:19.07,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.46,0:10:22.22,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone here lives alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.22,0:10:25.86,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I’m out of ideas, but I’ll\Nhelp you look for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:30.79,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much. I seem to\Ncause trouble for everyone I meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.16,0:10:33.39,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,It’s no trouble for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.39,0:10:35.34,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,You’re putting a lot of effort into this,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.34,0:10:37.68,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,and people want to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.68,0:10:39.19,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But that’s not...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.19,0:10:42.76,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,But you really shouldn’t go\Nknocking on strangers’ doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.36,0:10:46.09,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But Fujimoto-san told me that I wouldn’t feel complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.09,0:10:49.09,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,if I only did things for my own satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.09,0:10:50.52,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,That I’m like the person who abandoned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.98,0:10:53.20,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Will that guy ever change?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.66,0:10:54.90,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Forget what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:11:00.55,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t think anyone really wants to abandon such a cute little kitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.38,0:11:04.03,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,There must be some other reason for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.11,0:11:10.37,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,But Fujimoto-san seemed really gloomy when he said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.83,0:11:16.73,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,So Fujimoto-san is right in saying I can’t be half-hearted about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.73,0:11:18.84,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I should do what I can with all I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.33,0:11:23.26,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Oh, this time we’ll go to the homes of the people we know and ask them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.26,0:11:24.55,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, if anything happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.55,0:11:26.43,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,give me a call on my cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.77,0:11:29.89,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Kudo}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.14,0:11:43.18,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They don’t seem to be home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Sign,0000,0000,0000,,European Pastries [flower] Chiroru}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.58,0:11:47.24,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He’s taking a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.19,0:12:07.30,KM,keeper,0000,0000,0000,,Since we handle food here, having a cat…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.76,0:12:09.97,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.97,0:12:12.20,KM,keeper,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I can’t help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.79,0:12:19.01,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, Mihara residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.01,0:12:20.03,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.55,0:12:22.40,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Huh? A kitten?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.22,0:12:25.91,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I really wish we could keep it here…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.72,0:12:31.37,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,So those girls have been…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.37,0:12:33.60,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, understood. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.48,0:12:43.38,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.10,0:12:52.07,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It has really gotten dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.54,0:12:54.23,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,And Milk is all tuckered out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.26,0:12:57.52,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.52,0:13:00.69,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! It’s hungry again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.99,0:13:05.61,KM,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Ready… go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:07.68,KM,??,0000,0000,0000,,This one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:12.79,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s pathetic how I can’t do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.09,0:13:15.71,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,So we can’t even buy some stupid cat food?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:17.48,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.26,0:13:24.82,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Say, Chise-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.82,0:13:25.95,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:28.60,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,We really should ask Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.60,0:13:31.47,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I’m sure she will let you keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.47,0:13:34.19,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Then tonight we can sleep together with Milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.19,0:13:36.63,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, with Kobato-san too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.63,0:13:37.99,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.99,0:13:38.85,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.17,0:13:41.01,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,She was there when…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.01,0:13:41.86,KM,grandma,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{sign,0000,0000,0000,,Gabu Jougasaki}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.49,0:13:44.92,KM,grandma,0000,0000,0000,,The girl with that wonderful song.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.92,0:13:46.93,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know her, Kobato-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:48.17,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.17,0:13:50.51,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Um… how’s the baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.51,0:13:55.00,KM,grandma,0000,0000,0000,,Since she’s off from work today, his mother is looking after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.69,0:13:57.61,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.13,0:14:00.04,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Still, why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.60,0:14:05.55,KM,grandma,0000,0000,0000,,I heard that a girl, who was searching for someone to take in a kitten, lives here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.55,0:14:06.48,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:08.61,KM,grandma,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.33,0:14:11.43,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,What a lovely kitten!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.27,0:14:14.56,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,It’s so small and so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.89,0:14:19.36,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Is there any way I can take\Nthis little one home with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.36,0:14:20.93,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Do you really mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.93,0:14:23.11,KM,grandma,0000,0000,0000,,Of course. My grandchild is an only child,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.11,0:14:25.33,KM,grandma,0000,0000,0000,,so if he had a kitten to play with…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.46,0:14:29.74,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.74,0:14:33.83,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,…there are people who sneeze and get rashes when they touch cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.83,0:14:36.26,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Will the baby be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.26,0:14:39.33,KM,grandma,0000,0000,0000,,That pizza man was worried about the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:40.98,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Pizza man?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.98,0:14:41.76,KM,grandma,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.76,0:14:47.76,KM,grandma,0000,0000,0000,,After making each delivery, he would\Nearnestly ask if they could take in a kitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.92,0:14:51.48,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I heard him asking while I was passing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.90,0:14:55.93,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san did that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.93,0:14:59.08,KM,grandma,0000,0000,0000,,My grandson just loves animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.67,0:15:01.94,KM,grandma,0000,0000,0000,,So there are no cat allergies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.94,0:15:03.69,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.69,0:15:05.73,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Isn’t that great, Milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.73,0:15:07.19,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,You won’t be alone any more!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.39,0:15:14.28,KM,grandma,0000,0000,0000,,Well then…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.74,0:15:16.54,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye, Milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:17.87,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,We’ll come visit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.56,0:15:20.58,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.20,0:15:24.49,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Here’s Milk’s food!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.49,0:15:27.00,KM,grandma,0000,0000,0000,,My, it was well looked after.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.21,0:15:31.63,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Please take care of Milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.24,0:15:33.89,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.19,0:15:48.66,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The room seems much bigger without Milk here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.66,0:15:49.78,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.78,0:15:52.11,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,And what a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.61,0:15:54.84,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,What th{\fscx200}-{\r}?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.84,0:15:57.33,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Milk’s milkbowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.49,0:16:02.59,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I’m sure Chiho-chan and Chise-chan feel like I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.94,0:16:07.57,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Where’re you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:12.13,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.04,0:16:14.34,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.34,0:16:15.47,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.29,0:16:17.47,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:21.76,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Chiho and Chise are up on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.27,0:16:30.91,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if Milk is being loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.91,0:16:33.72,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,She seemed like such a nice old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.70,0:16:37.45,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everything will be fine with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.21,0:16:39.59,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.65,0:16:41.70,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,That’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.43,0:16:45.42,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I forgot to give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.69,0:16:48.92,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Milk’s… milkbowl…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.39,0:16:50.68,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:58.30,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Come to think of it, when I first met that lady, there was a full moon too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.05,0:17:02.47,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,The cherry blossoms were\Nblooming ever so beautifully.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.31,0:17:07.47,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,The baby she was taking for a walk,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.47,0:17:10.11,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,wouldn’t stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.81,0:17:14.11,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I tried consoling the baby…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.11,0:17:15.26,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.26,0:17:17.98,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,But I only made him cry even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.98,0:17:19.70,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,And then what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.64,0:17:25.04,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then… I sang a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.30,0:17:26.29,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.29,0:17:28.49,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,You sing, Kobato-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.49,0:17:29.74,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.74,0:17:32.70,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Then after that, the baby stopped crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.70,0:17:34.66,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,What did you sing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.66,0:17:35.38,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.23,0:17:37.98,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Let’s see…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.98,0:17:39.31,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,I want to hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.31,0:17:40.97,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,I want to hear it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.97,0:17:41.87,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:43.30,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Let us hear it, Kobato-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.63,0:17:45.18,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.09,0:17:48.49,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Keeper: song's from episode 1,2121,0000,0000,0000,,“subete migaite aru miteru“ ---->“subete idaite aruiteru“/??????????/I embrace them all and continue to walk}}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.54,0:18:32.86,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That song…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.02,0:20:24.33,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.33,0:20:27.22,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I want to thank you for trying to help Milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.07,0:20:32.06,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,It got a wonderful new owner!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.67,0:20:35.06,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,And it’s all thanks to you, Fujimoto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.54,0:20:38.54,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That’s all you wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.54,0:20:39.66,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.79,0:20:45.76,KM,Fujimto,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.76,0:20:48.53,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I just remembered something important!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.53,0:20:51.54,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Could you perhaps lend me a phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.79,0:20:55.17,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Then, could you call me back if\Nyou know someone who likes cats?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.17,0:20:56.93,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Sure, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Cell TS,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto Kiyokazu}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.60,0:21:01.84,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.96,0:21:03.84,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.16,0:21:08.35,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um… well…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.35,0:21:11.17,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Uh… Kobato-chan? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.17,0:21:15.81,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! W-Well, we found someone\Nwho was willing to take in the kitten!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.34,0:21:18.51,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted to let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.51,0:21:19.48,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.48,0:21:22.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Fujimoto-san found her for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.89,0:21:24.10,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu did?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.02,0:21:27.53,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.53,0:21:30.62,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry to make you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.91,0:21:33.76,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t be. I’m glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.76,0:21:34.87,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.22,0:21:42.42,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There’s more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.81,0:21:44.79,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.79,0:21:48.86,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,The one who found the new\Nowner for Milk was Fujimoto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.86,0:21:50.68,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I didn’t do anything to help{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.68,0:21:53.07,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Of course you weren’t any stinkin’ help!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.07,0:21:57.27,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,You just {\i1}had{\i0} to bring home that kitten and cause people pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.60,0:22:04.84,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. It’s all my fault that I caused trouble for everyone and made them worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.84,0:22:07.42,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you spend money to make money.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.42,0:22:09.42,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That’s how the world works.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.42,0:22:10.41,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.62,0:22:15.74,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You sang that song to Chiho and Chise after seeing,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.74,0:22:17.71,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,how sad they were without that kitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.71,0:22:22.10,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I was only telling them about that lady and the baby{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.10,0:22:25.38,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,And those feelings you\Nrelayed soothed their spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.51,0:22:30.25,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So I can heal people through songs as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.25,0:22:31.76,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But still…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.76,0:22:34.14,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,My ear is still not healed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.14,0:22:35.38,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Because of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.38,0:22:37.37,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,A big fat zero, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.49,0:22:45.07,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, but since it’s a circle, it looks like the moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.07,0:22:46.98,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Quit being so damn happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.98,0:22:51.89,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah, and Milk’s milkbowl is\Nalso a circle! They all go together!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.89,0:22:55.45,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Fine then! You like circles so much, all\Nyou’re gonna get are zeros from now on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.45,0:22:59.37,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1200)}That’s mean, Ioryogi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{ED}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Next Episode TS,0000,0000,0000,,Summertime Memories}
